#: source/release-notes/rl-2.33.md:147
msgid "\"/nix/store\""
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.33.md:148
msgid "\"info\""
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.33.md:152
msgid ""
"The map from [store path base names](../store/store-path.md#base-name) to "
"store object info is nested under the `info` field."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.33.md:154
msgid ""
"**[Store path base names](../store/store-path.md#base-name) instead of full "
